Concerns/Blockers: MAJOR-1 (phase-02 drain/buffer/budget spec gap); MINORs: roadmap Depends unsynced, D3 null-source_id infeasible post-rekey + unenumerated ripples, moralis direction wording, `internal` missing from never-list, tier-2 probe-BLOCKED undefined, transfer_index divergence agenda item.
